{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56095","headline":"光明赞 · 杜光庭","name":"光明赞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"立功须及早，学道亦当时。\n昼夜宜勤学，发意莫狐疑。\n烧香常礼拜，诵经恒奉师。\n勇猛加精进，专诚无想思。\n四等将六度，三奔与五雌。\n洗尘入空寂，虚心将自持。\n唯期不转退，岂爲人所嗤。\n若能如是者，朝夕自仙飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56095.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56095","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}